      "title": "Mptraj",
      "classification": "substantive",
      "coverage": "pending",
      "text": [
        "Mptraj",
        "• Contains ~1,580,000 3D crystal structures drawn from materials project database.",
        "• This dataset spans 89 chemical elements in all kinds of inorganic compounds.",
        "Means an ML model sees examples of many bonding environments.",
        "• A “universal” dataset used to train GNN potentials that aim to work for any material."
      ],
      "media_sha256": [
        "ece3c0b675b6058b47671987f14e625125d2a1ff9dad1451974ca802985fbe26",
