    {
      "slide": 31,
      "pptx_slide": 31,
      "title": "Does Equivariance Matter at Scale?",
      "classification": "substantive",
      "coverage": "pending",
      "text": [
        "Does Equivariance Matter at Scale?",
        "• Performs large-scale study on",
        "rigid body modelling problem",
        "using E(3) equivariant",
        "Transformer.",
        "• IMO, we need more studies like",
        "these for conclusion and still",
        "debatable!"
