    {
      "slide": 32,
      "pptx_slide": 32,
      "title": "SevenNet",
      "classification": "substantive",
      "coverage": "pending",
      "text": [
        "SevenNet",
        "• Propose an efficient parallelization scheme",
        "compatible with GNN interatomic potentials.",
        "• Pretrains NequIP-like architecture on",
        "Materials Project dataset."
      ],
      "media_sha256": [
        "23b3cdd8e1669ad169c5d621a64ac2fc9b029531cd049efcf542573ea0ee137e",
        "09ef6df39160bca5b3b12577cd9c3079e5b6d8ec5c354cd146f518392358b077"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "slide": 33,
      "pptx_slide": 33,
      "title": "SevenNet",
      "classification": "substantive",
      "coverage": "pending",
      "text": [
        "SevenNet",
        "• Spatial decomposition is a",
        "parallelization strategy that takes",
        "advantage of the shortrange nature of",
        "chemical interactions.",
        "• Initially, the simulation cell is spatially",
        "decomposed into smaller subdomains,",
        "which are then distributed among",
        "processors.",
        "• If the neighboring atoms belong to other",
        "processors, “ghost” atoms are created to",
        "provide the necessary information."
      ],
      "media_sha256": [
        "f35b2381496848d05f76af55d1a8add7dbeebd689635e733c5feab0843e81c16"
      ],
      "notes": ""
