      "text": [
        "eSEN",
        "Key ideas: Desideratum for physical property prediction",
        "• Force fields need to be conservative:",
        "• Bound energy derivatives for energy conversation over SDE solvers:",
        "• How?",
        "• Don’t use direct force field prediction.",
        "• For bounding energy derivatives, use envelope functions with distance cutoff for neighbors.",
        "Use Bessel radial basis function over Gaussian radial basis function,",
        "which is less sensitive to shifts in the atom positions."
